Blinkered word list for Cymraeg (cy)
SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-3.0-or-later

This file is generated. It is not a copy of any dictionary. It is the list of words that
appear in a frequency-ordered corpus of cy AND are accepted by every validator
below, filtered to what the game can deal as tiles. Neither input is redistributed here.
Rebuild it with `pnpm dictionary build --language=cy`.

Distributed under LGPL-3.0-or-later, which is the most restrictive of the terms below. See
PROVENANCE.md for what was relied on and why.

Ordering
  cy.wikipedia.org contributors, word counts over the article text of the pages-articles dump
  CC-BY-SA-4.0

Validation
  hunspell `cy` (LGPL-3.0-or-later) — Welsh spelling dictionary, Kevin Donnelly and the Cysill / Meddal project

The full text of each license is in ../licenses/.
